    "Name": "King Crab KGC-0010M",
    "Details": "Designed and produced for the Magistracy of Canopus; as part of an upgrade of mothballed Succession Wars era Mechs, the KGC-0010M takes the already fearsome King Crab and upgrades it with new weapons and 2.5 tons of extra armor. Quad Plasma Rifles form the primary weaponry, backed up by a Snub Nose PPC and a single Rocket Launcher 15. A Beagle Active Probe is the last addition, perfect for the ecm choked battlefields of the 32nd century.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
